      <li>Crafting</li>
      <li>Construction</li>
    </forcedPassions>
    <degreeDatas>
      <li>
        <label>forge master</label>
        <description>[PAWN_nameDef] speaks in metal and mortar. Give [PAWN_objective] a forge and stand back. [PAWN_pronoun] doesn't explain [PAWN_possessive] process, doesn't invite feedback, and has very little patience for people who've never built anything.</description>
