      <li>
        <label>phoenix heart</label>
        <description>[PAWN_nameDef]'s body treats injury as a temporary state. Cuts close. Fevers break fast. [PAWN_pronoun] has been through things that should have left lasting damage, and mostly hasn't let them.</description>
