      <li>
        <label>combustive temper</label>
        <description>[PAWN_nameDef] has a short fuse and knows it. [PAWN_pronoun] doesn't always go looking for a fight, but [PAWN_pronoun] finds one reliably. In the middle of one, [PAWN_pronoun] is devastating. Anything requiring patience or a steady hand, [PAWN_pronoun] is not your first choice.</description>
